es after discount, plus tax on that sum.\"\"\"\n-    gross = sum((li.unit_price * li.qty for li in inv.lines), Decimal(\"0\"))\n-    discount_amount = Decimal(\"0\")\n-    for li in inv.lines:\n-        if li.discount is not None:\n-            discount_amount += li.unit_price * li.qty * li.discount.percent / Decimal(100)\n-    net = round_money(gross - discount_amount)\n+    net = sum(line_totals(inv), Decimal(\"0\"))\n     return round_money(net + tax_for(net, inv.tax_rule))\n....                                                                     [100%]\n4 passed in 0.02s","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TjJJ3B1ciynNyZh8SgiKA3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrzwoDKGbFqbh27bnY7Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the off-by-one-cent totals. The full suite passes (4 tests, including the new regression test).\n\n**Root cause:** `invoice_total()` in `billing/totals.py` computed the discount on the whole invoice and rounded once at the end. The PDF prints `line_totals()`, which rounds each line to the cent. When several discounted lines each end in a half-cent, the rounding diverges. For example, two lines of 10.05 at 10% off print as 9.05 + 9.05 = 18.10, but the old total came out as 18.09. Without discounts there is nothing to round per line, so those invoices were never affected. Nothing errors, so there was nothing in the logs.\n\n**Fix:** `invoice_total()` now sums `line_totals(inv)`, so the charged amount equals the sum of the printed lines. Tax is still computed on that sum. No public signatures changed. `round_money` is still used on the last line of the function, so the import stays.\n\n**Test:** `test_total_matches_printed_line_items_with_discounts` in `tests/test_billing.py` uses the two-line case above. It checks that `invoice_total` equals the sum of `line_totals` and comes to 18.10.\n\nI haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10305,"cache_read_input_tokens":31170,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10305},"output_tokens":403,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7165b3da-457b-4110-9d76-9e7b83a8a0f2","uuid":"8d902334-0483-4192-87c0-787e2bc197c1","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:44:27.904Z","request_id":"req_011Cfrzwnxges56hJMD3EY3Z"}
